<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan ups'97'98 AK Steel estimate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan ups'97'98 AK Steel estimate.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>- J.P. Morgan steel analyst Mike Gambardella said he raised his full-year '97 estimate on AK Steel Corp to $4.75 from $4.40 per share.</p>
<p>-- Gambardella also raised his full-year '98 estimate to $3.00 from $2.50 per share.</p>
<p>-- Gambardella said second-quarter results were better than expected. AK Steel posted earnings of $1.26 per share, beating his estimate of $1.23 and Wall Street's consensus of $1.19.</p>
</text>
